OL,3,A'I decided I was going to be Taylor
OL,4,ASwift' - singer goes from busking to
OL,5,AThe Voice UK winner
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe winner of the Voice UK says she
OL,8,Fdecided "I was going to be Taylor
OL,9,FSwift" as a teenager after being given
OL,10,Fa guitar, before busking on the streets
OL,11,Fof Cardiff.
OL,13,FWelsh singer Cate McHugh was crowned
OL,14,Fthe winner of the show on Saturday,
OL,15,Fafter being mentored by "the legend
OL,16,Fthat is Sir Tom Jones".
OL,18,FMcHugh, from Llantwit Major, in the
OL,19,FVale of Glamorgan, said Sir Tom was so
OL,20,Fwarm and supportive that it felt "as if
OL,21,Fyou've known him for years".
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,168,160,200,105,0,100
