OL,3,A'I decided I was going to be Taylor
OL,4,ASwift' - singer goes from busking to
OL,5,AThe Voice UK winner
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne of the standout pieces of advice he
OL,8,Fgave to her early on was to focus on
OL,9,Fthe story being told in the song, she
OL,10,Fexplained.
